ops most duplicates","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rather than all, so a recovered record Segment had already stored before the app ended is most","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"likely not stored again. RudderStack’s and Customer.io’s references don’t say whether they","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deduplicate. The record’s vendor identifier","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and trace context, and any other context value, aren’t sent.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"context.ip","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"0.0.0.0\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in every call, which the spec reads as the user’s address, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Segment records no address from the request. RudderStack fills in a ","type":"text"},{"code":"request_ip","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" member from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the request unless the call has one, even when ","type":"text"},{"code":"context.ip","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is set, and passes it on to its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"destinations, so RudderStack’s calls also carry ","type":"text"},{"code":"request_ip","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" as ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"0.0.0.0\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Customer.io’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"references don’t say whether ","type":"text"},{"code":"context.ip","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" takes the place of the address it reads from an HTTP","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"request. No call to Segment or Customer.io carries ","type":"text"},{"code":"request_ip","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which their specs don’t have.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"No ","type":"text"},{"code":"sentAt","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"originalTimestamp","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"channel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is sent. Without ","type":"text"},{"code":"sentAt","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" the endpoint takes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"timestamp","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" as it is, uncorrected for the device’s clock; it is left out on purpose, as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"retried request sends the same body again, whose ","type":"text"},{"code":"sentAt","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" would be the first attempt’s.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"RudderStack, whose references list all three as required, fills them in from when it received","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the call.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Properties are read through the event’s schema in "},{"code":"plan","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", as "},{"code":"PropertyReader","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" reads them. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Sensitive"},{"type":"text","text":" value is never sent, whatever the record reveals: the property is left"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"out, an element of an array is "},{"code":"null","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and one inside a type the plan can’t map is "},{"code":"null","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"context"},{"type":"text","text":" holds these members, for each of the keys the record’s context has a value for:"}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Member"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Key","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Holds","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineCont